{"lineas":[{"speaker":"Paula","start":0,"end":9.52,"text":"Okay, Ethan, I need you to take this seriously, because today I'm bringing you one of the most devastating military defeats in the entire history of modern warfare.","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":0,"e":0.64},{"w":"Ethan,","s":0.64,"e":1.2},{"w":"I","s":1.2,"e":1.36},{"w":"need","s":1.36,"e":1.6},{"w":"you","s":1.6,"e":1.76},{"w":"to","s":1.76,"e":1.92},{"w":"take","s":1.92,"e":2.08},{"w":"this","s":2.08,"e":2.32},{"w":"seriously,","s":2.32,"e":3.12},{"w":"because","s":3.28,"e":3.6},{"w":"today","s":3.6,"e":3.92},{"w":"I'm","s":3.92,"e":4.16},{"w":"bringing","s":4.16,"e":4.48},{"w":"you","s":4.48,"e":4.64},{"w":"one","s":4.64,"e":4.88},{"w":"of","s":4.88,"e":5.04},{"w":"the","s":5.04,"e":5.2},{"w":"most","s":5.2,"e":5.44},{"w":"devastating","s":5.44,"e":6.16},{"w":"military","s":6.16,"e":6.64},{"w":"defeats","s":6.64,"e":7.12},{"w":"in","s":7.12,"e":7.28},{"w":"the","s":7.28,"e":7.44},{"w":"entire","s":7.44,"e":7.84},{"w":"history","s":7.84,"e":8.24},{"w":"of","s":8.24,"e":8.48},{"w":"modern","s":8.48,"e":8.8},{"w":"warfare.","s":8.8,"e":9.52}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":9.82,"end":18.644,"text":"Oh, I love it when you get all dramatic like this, because it usually means the story is either heartbreaking or completely, gloriously ridiculous. Which one is it?","words":[{"w":"Oh,","s":9.82,"e":10.48},{"w":"I","s":10.48,"e":10.64},{"w":"love","s":10.64,"e":10.8},{"w":"it","s":10.8,"e":10.88},{"w":"when","s":10.88,"e":11.04},{"w":"you","s":11.04,"e":11.2},{"w":"get","s":11.2,"e":11.28},{"w":"all","s":11.28,"e":11.52},{"w":"dramatic","s":11.52,"e":11.92},{"w":"like","s":11.92,"e":12.16},{"w":"this,","s":12.16,"e":12.32},{"w":"because","s":12.605,"e":12.925},{"w":"it","s":12.925,"e":13.085},{"w":"usually","s":13.085,"e":13.405},{"w":"means","s":13.405,"e":13.645},{"w":"the","s":13.645,"e":13.885},{"w":"story","s":13.885,"e":14.205},{"w":"is","s":14.205,"e":14.365},{"w":"either","s":14.365,"e":14.605},{"w":"heartbreaking","s":14.605,"e":15.165},{"w":"or","s":15.165,"e":15.405},{"w":"completely,","s":15.405,"e":16.125},{"w":"gloriously","s":16.125,"e":16.605},{"w":"ridiculous.","s":16.605,"e":17.565},{"w":"Which","s":17.805,"e":18.045},{"w":"one","s":18.045,"e":18.205},{"w":"is","s":18.205,"e":18.365},{"w":"it?","s":18.365,"e":18.644}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":19.044,"end":31.536,"text":"Nineteen thirty-two. Western Australia. The Australian army deploys soldiers with machine guns against an invading force of twenty thousand... and I want you to sit with this... emus.","words":[{"w":"Nineteen","s":19.245,"e":19.725},{"w":"thirty-two.","s":19.725,"e":20.925},{"w":"Western","s":20.925,"e":21.405},{"w":"Australia.","s":21.405,"e":22.285},{"w":"The","s":22.365,"e":22.525},{"w":"Australian","s":22.525,"e":23.005},{"w":"army","s":23.005,"e":23.485},{"w":"deploys","s":23.485,"e":23.965},{"w":"soldiers","s":23.965,"e":24.525},{"w":"with","s":24.525,"e":24.765},{"w":"machine","s":24.765,"e":25.165},{"w":"guns","s":25.165,"e":25.965},{"w":"against","s":25.7,"e":26.1},{"w":"an","s":26.1,"e":26.34},{"w":"invading","s":26.34,"e":26.82},{"w":"force","s":26.82,"e":27.22},{"w":"of","s":27.22,"e":27.54},{"w":"twenty","s":27.54,"e":28.02},{"w":"thousand...","s":28.02,"e":28.74},{"w":"and","s":28.9,"e":29.06},{"w":"I","s":29.06,"e":29.22},{"w":"want","s":29.22,"e":29.46},{"w":"you","s":29.46,"e":29.62},{"w":"to","s":29.62,"e":29.7},{"w":"sit","s":29.7,"e":30.02},{"w":"with","s":30.02,"e":30.18},{"w":"this...","s":30.18,"e":30.74},{"w":"emus.","s":30.74,"e":31.536}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":31.836,"end":42.424,"text":"Emus. The birds. You're telling me a professional military force pointed actual machine guns at giant flightless birds, and somehow this counts as a war? I refuse to believe it.","words":[{"w":"Emus.","s":31.836,"e":32.66},{"w":"The","s":32.66,"e":32.98},{"w":"birds.","s":32.98,"e":33.7},{"w":"You're","s":33.78,"e":34.1},{"w":"telling","s":34.1,"e":34.34},{"w":"me","s":34.34,"e":34.42},{"w":"a","s":34.42,"e":34.66},{"w":"professional","s":34.66,"e":35.06},{"w":"military","s":35.06,"e":35.62},{"w":"force","s":35.62,"e":35.94},{"w":"pointed","s":35.94,"e":36.34},{"w":"actual","s":36.34,"e":36.82},{"w":"machine","s":36.82,"e":37.14},{"w":"guns","s":37.14,"e":37.46},{"w":"at","s":37.46,"e":37.62},{"w":"giant","s":37.62,"e":37.94},{"w":"flightless","s":37.94,"e":38.42},{"w":"birds,","s":38.42,"e":39.06},{"w":"and","s":39.14,"e":39.3},{"w":"somehow","s":39.3,"e":39.7},{"w":"this","s":39.7,"e":39.94},{"w":"counts","s":39.94,"e":40.18},{"w":"as","s":40.18,"e":40.34},{"w":"a","s":40.34,"e":40.5},{"w":"war?","s":40.5,"e":40.74},{"w":"I","s":41.165,"e":41.405},{"w":"refuse","s":41.405,"e":41.725},{"w":"to","s":41.725,"e":41.885},{"w":"believe","s":41.885,"e":42.125},{"w":"it.","s":42.125,"e":42.424}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":42.724,"end":54.381,"text":"Believe it. And here's the part nobody expects: the birds won. Decisively. The army retreated twice, and the whole thing became an international embarrassment for the government.","words":[{"w":"Believe","s":42.765,"e":43.165},{"w":"it.","s":43.165,"e":43.645},{"w":"And","s":43.885,"e":44.045},{"w":"here's","s":44.045,"e":44.525},{"w":"the","s":44.525,"e":44.685},{"w":"part","s":44.685,"e":44.925},{"w":"nobody","s":44.925,"e":45.485},{"w":"expects:","s":45.485,"e":46.285},{"w":"the","s":46.285,"e":46.445},{"w":"birds","s":46.445,"e":46.845},{"w":"won.","s":46.845,"e":47.405},{"w":"Decisively.","s":47.645,"e":48.605},{"w":"The","s":48.925,"e":49.085},{"w":"army","s":49.085,"e":49.405},{"w":"retreated","s":49.405,"e":49.965},{"w":"twice,","s":49.965,"e":50.605},{"w":"and","s":50.605,"e":50.765},{"w":"the","s":50.765,"e":50.925},{"w":"whole","s":50.925,"e":51.165},{"w":"thing","s":51.165,"e":51.405},{"w":"became","s":51.405,"e":51.805},{"w":"an","s":51.805,"e":52.045},{"w":"international","s":52.045,"e":52.765},{"w":"embarrassment","s":52.765,"e":53.485},{"w":"for","s":53.485,"e":53.645},{"w":"the","s":53.645,"e":53.805},{"w":"government.","s":53.805,"e":54.125}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":54.681,"end":64.48,"text":"Okay, hold on, back up, because I have so many questions. Who looked at a bird problem and thought, you know what this needs? Artillery. Who does that?","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":55.55,"e":56.03},{"w":"hold","s":56.03,"e":56.27},{"w":"on,","s":56.27,"e":56.59},{"w":"back","s":56.59,"e":56.75},{"w":"up,","s":56.75,"e":57.31},{"w":"because","s":57.39,"e":57.63},{"w":"I","s":57.63,"e":57.79},{"w":"have","s":57.79,"e":58.03},{"w":"so","s":58.03,"e":58.19},{"w":"many","s":58.19,"e":58.43},{"w":"questions.","s":58.43,"e":59.07},{"w":"Who","s":59.39,"e":59.63},{"w":"looked","s":59.63,"e":59.87},{"w":"at","s":59.87,"e":59.95},{"w":"a","s":59.95,"e":60.11},{"w":"bird","s":60.11,"e":60.35},{"w":"problem","s":60.35,"e":60.67},{"w":"and","s":60.67,"e":60.91},{"w":"thought,","s":60.91,"e":61.23},{"w":"you","s":61.23,"e":61.39},{"w":"know","s":61.39,"e":61.55},{"w":"what","s":61.55,"e":61.71},{"w":"this","s":61.71,"e":61.95},{"w":"needs?","s":61.95,"e":62.51},{"w":"Artillery.","s":62.59,"e":63.55},{"w":"Who","s":63.63,"e":63.87},{"w":"does","s":63.87,"e":64.03},{"w":"that?","s":64.03,"e":64.48}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":64.88,"end":75.05,"text":"Desperate people, honestly. The farmers out there were veterans of the First World War, and the Great Depression had already crushed them before a single bird showed up.","words":[{"w":"Desperate","s":64.99,"e":65.47},{"w":"people,","s":65.47,"e":66.11},{"w":"honestly.","s":66.11,"e":66.59},{"w":"The","s":66.995,"e":67.315},{"w":"farmers","s":67.315,"e":67.715},{"w":"out","s":67.715,"e":67.955},{"w":"there","s":67.955,"e":68.115},{"w":"were","s":68.115,"e":68.355},{"w":"veterans","s":68.355,"e":68.755},{"w":"of","s":68.755,"e":69.075},{"w":"the","s":69.075,"e":69.155},{"w":"First","s":69.155,"e":69.475},{"w":"World","s":69.475,"e":69.875},{"w":"War,","s":69.875,"e":70.435},{"w":"and","s":70.435,"e":70.595},{"w":"the","s":70.595,"e":70.755},{"w":"Great","s":70.755,"e":70.995},{"w":"Depression","s":70.995,"e":71.395},{"w":"had","s":71.395,"e":71.715},{"w":"already","s":71.715,"e":72.195},{"w":"crushed","s":72.195,"e":72.515},{"w":"them","s":72.515,"e":72.995},{"w":"before","s":72.995,"e":73.395},{"w":"a","s":73.395,"e":73.635},{"w":"single","s":73.635,"e":73.955},{"w":"bird","s":73.955,"e":74.355},{"w":"showed","s":74.355,"e":74.675},{"w":"up.","s":74.675,"e":75.05}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":75.35,"end":84.87,"text":"Oh, so there's a real human story hiding under the ridiculous one. That's sneaky, Paula. Now I feel bad for laughing at these poor guys and their bird apocalypse.","words":[{"w":"Oh,","s":75.35,"e":76.035},{"w":"so","s":76.115,"e":76.275},{"w":"there's","s":76.275,"e":76.595},{"w":"a","s":76.595,"e":76.755},{"w":"real","s":76.755,"e":76.995},{"w":"human","s":76.995,"e":77.395},{"w":"story","s":77.395,"e":77.715},{"w":"hiding","s":77.715,"e":78.115},{"w":"under","s":78.115,"e":78.275},{"w":"the","s":78.275,"e":78.435},{"w":"ridiculous","s":78.435,"e":78.995},{"w":"one.","s":78.995,"e":79.235},{"w":"That's","s":79.75,"e":80.15},{"w":"sneaky,","s":80.15,"e":80.55},{"w":"Paula.","s":80.55,"e":81.19},{"w":"Now","s":81.35,"e":81.59},{"w":"I","s":81.59,"e":81.75},{"w":"feel","s":81.75,"e":81.99},{"w":"bad","s":81.99,"e":82.15},{"w":"for","s":82.15,"e":82.31},{"w":"laughing","s":82.31,"e":82.63},{"w":"at","s":82.63,"e":82.79},{"w":"these","s":82.79,"e":83.03},{"w":"poor","s":83.03,"e":83.27},{"w":"guys","s":83.27,"e":83.51},{"w":"and","s":83.51,"e":83.67},{"w":"their","s":83.67,"e":83.83},{"w":"bird","s":83.83,"e":84.07},{"w":"apocalypse.","s":84.07,"e":84.87}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":85.17,"end":98.034,"text":"Feel bad, then keep laughing. The government gave these veterans farmland out west. Wheat prices collapsed, promised subsidies never came — and then twenty thousand emus marched straight into their crops.","words":[{"w":"Feel","s":85.17,"e":85.51},{"w":"bad,","s":85.51,"e":85.83},{"w":"then","s":85.83,"e":85.99},{"w":"keep","s":85.99,"e":86.31},{"w":"laughing.","s":86.31,"e":87.03},{"w":"The","s":87.35,"e":87.51},{"w":"government","s":87.51,"e":87.99},{"w":"gave","s":87.99,"e":88.31},{"w":"these","s":88.31,"e":88.63},{"w":"veterans","s":88.63,"e":89.03},{"w":"farmland","s":89.03,"e":89.67},{"w":"out","s":89.67,"e":89.99},{"w":"west.","s":89.99,"e":90.63},{"w":"Wheat","s":90.71,"e":91.03},{"w":"prices","s":91.03,"e":91.43},{"w":"collapsed,","s":91.43,"e":91.91},{"w":"promised","s":92.105,"e":92.585},{"w":"subsidies","s":92.585,"e":93.305},{"w":"never","s":93.305,"e":93.625},{"w":"came","s":93.625,"e":94.105},{"w":"—","s":94.105,"e":94.265},{"w":"and","s":94.265,"e":94.425},{"w":"then","s":94.425,"e":94.665},{"w":"twenty","s":94.665,"e":95.065},{"w":"thousand","s":95.065,"e":95.465},{"w":"emus","s":95.465,"e":95.945},{"w":"marched","s":95.945,"e":96.505},{"w":"straight","s":96.505,"e":96.905},{"w":"into","s":96.905,"e":97.225},{"w":"their","s":97.225,"e":97.385},{"w":"crops.","s":97.385,"e":98.034}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":98.334,"end":102.56,"text":"Twenty thousand. That's not a flock, that's an army with feathers.","words":[{"w":"Twenty","s":98.425,"e":98.745},{"w":"thousand.","s":98.745,"e":99.465},{"w":"That's","s":99.705,"e":100.025},{"w":"not","s":100.025,"e":100.185},{"w":"a","s":100.185,"e":100.345},{"w":"flock,","s":100.345,"e":100.985},{"w":"that's","s":101.065,"e":101.305},{"w":"an","s":101.305,"e":101.385},{"w":"army","s":101.385,"e":101.705},{"w":"with","s":101.705,"e":101.945},{"w":"feathers.","s":101.945,"e":102.56}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":102.86,"end":112.287,"text":"Exactly how the farmers saw it. Being ex-soldiers, they asked for a soldier's solution: machine guns. And the Minister of Defence said... sure.","words":[{"w":"Exactly","s":102.86,"e":103.385},{"w":"how","s":103.385,"e":103.625},{"w":"the","s":103.625,"e":103.865},{"w":"farmers","s":103.865,"e":104.265},{"w":"saw","s":104.265,"e":104.505},{"w":"it.","s":104.505,"e":104.665},{"w":"Being","s":105,"e":105.32},{"w":"ex-soldiers,","s":105.32,"e":106.28},{"w":"they","s":106.28,"e":106.44},{"w":"asked","s":106.44,"e":106.76},{"w":"for","s":106.76,"e":106.92},{"w":"a","s":106.92,"e":107.08},{"w":"soldier's","s":107.08,"e":107.56},{"w":"solution:","s":107.56,"e":108.2},{"w":"machine","s":108.36,"e":108.76},{"w":"guns.","s":108.76,"e":109.48},{"w":"And","s":109.56,"e":109.72},{"w":"the","s":109.72,"e":109.88},{"w":"Minister","s":109.88,"e":110.28},{"w":"of","s":110.28,"e":110.52},{"w":"Defence","s":110.52,"e":110.92},{"w":"said...","s":110.92,"e":111.64},{"w":"sure.","s":111.64,"e":112.28}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":112.587,"end":114.863,"text":"No way. He just said yes?","words":[{"w":"No","s":112.587,"e":112.92},{"w":"way.","s":112.92,"e":113.48},{"w":"He","s":113.72,"e":113.88},{"w":"just","s":113.88,"e":114.12},{"w":"said","s":114.12,"e":114.36},{"w":"yes?","s":114.36,"e":114.863}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":115.263,"end":125.619,"text":"He did. So in November 1932, Major Meredith arrives with two soldiers, two Lewis machine guns, and ten thousand rounds of ammunition.","words":[{"w":"He","s":115.263,"e":115.48},{"w":"did.","s":115.48,"e":116.04},{"w":"So","s":116.36,"e":116.6},{"w":"in","s":116.6,"e":116.76},{"w":"November","s":116.76,"e":117.24},{"w":"1932,","s":117.24,"e":118.705},{"w":"Major","s":118.705,"e":119.185},{"w":"Meredith","s":119.185,"e":119.745},{"w":"arrives","s":119.745,"e":120.385},{"w":"with","s":120.385,"e":120.705},{"w":"two","s":120.705,"e":120.945},{"w":"soldiers,","s":120.945,"e":121.745},{"w":"two","s":121.745,"e":121.985},{"w":"Lewis","s":121.985,"e":122.385},{"w":"machine","s":122.385,"e":122.785},{"w":"guns,","s":122.785,"e":123.425},{"w":"and","s":123.425,"e":123.585},{"w":"ten","s":123.585,"e":123.905},{"w":"thousand","s":123.905,"e":124.305},{"w":"rounds","s":124.305,"e":124.625},{"w":"of","s":124.625,"e":124.865},{"w":"ammunition.","s":124.865,"e":125.619}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":125.919,"end":130.284,"text":"Against birds. I keep saying it because I keep not believing it.","words":[{"w":"Against","s":125.985,"e":126.305},{"w":"birds.","s":126.305,"e":127.105},{"w":"I","s":127.745,"e":127.985},{"w":"keep","s":127.985,"e":128.225},{"w":"saying","s":128.225,"e":128.465},{"w":"it","s":128.465,"e":128.705},{"w":"because","s":128.705,"e":128.945},{"w":"I","s":128.945,"e":129.105},{"w":"keep","s":129.105,"e":129.345},{"w":"not","s":129.345,"e":129.585},{"w":"believing","s":129.585,"e":129.985},{"w":"it.","s":129.985,"e":130.284}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":130.584,"end":137.968,"text":"On paper it looked easy: big targets, open fields, trained gunners. The army thought it would take a week.","words":[{"w":"On","s":130.584,"e":130.865},{"w":"paper","s":130.865,"e":131.265},{"w":"it","s":131.265,"e":131.585},{"w":"looked","s":131.585,"e":131.905},{"w":"easy:","s":131.905,"e":132.305},{"w":"big","s":132.7,"e":133.02},{"w":"targets,","s":133.02,"e":133.66},{"w":"open","s":133.66,"e":134.06},{"w":"fields,","s":134.06,"e":134.78},{"w":"trained","s":134.78,"e":135.1},{"w":"gunners.","s":135.1,"e":135.82},{"w":"The","s":136.14,"e":136.3},{"w":"army","s":136.3,"e":136.62},{"w":"thought","s":136.62,"e":136.94},{"w":"it","s":136.94,"e":137.02},{"w":"would","s":137.02,"e":137.26},{"w":"take","s":137.26,"e":137.42},{"w":"a","s":137.42,"e":137.58},{"w":"week.","s":137.58,"e":137.968}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":138.268,"end":140.73,"text":"Let me guess. It did not take a week.","words":[{"w":"Let","s":138.268,"e":138.46},{"w":"me","s":138.46,"e":138.62},{"w":"guess.","s":138.62,"e":139.26},{"w":"It","s":139.34,"e":139.5},{"w":"did","s":139.5,"e":139.74},{"w":"not","s":139.74,"e":139.9},{"w":"take","s":139.9,"e":140.14},{"w":"a","s":140.14,"e":140.22},{"w":"week.","s":140.22,"e":140.73}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":141.03,"end":150.875,"text":"It went pear-shaped almost immediately. First ambush: the emus scattered into small groups, ran in zigzags, and the gun jammed after killing barely a dozen.","words":[{"w":"It","s":141.03,"e":141.18},{"w":"went","s":141.18,"e":141.5},{"w":"pear-shaped","s":141.5,"e":142.14},{"w":"almost","s":142.14,"e":142.7},{"w":"immediately.","s":142.7,"e":143.58},{"w":"First","s":143.82,"e":144.06},{"w":"ambush:","s":144.06,"e":144.62},{"w":"the","s":144.815,"e":145.055},{"w":"emus","s":145.055,"e":145.535},{"w":"scattered","s":145.535,"e":146.015},{"w":"into","s":146.015,"e":146.335},{"w":"small","s":146.335,"e":146.655},{"w":"groups,","s":146.655,"e":147.295},{"w":"ran","s":147.295,"e":147.535},{"w":"in","s":147.535,"e":147.695},{"w":"zigzags,","s":147.695,"e":148.255},{"w":"and","s":148.255,"e":148.495},{"w":"the","s":148.495,"e":148.655},{"w":"gun","s":148.655,"e":148.895},{"w":"jammed","s":148.895,"e":149.215},{"w":"after","s":149.215,"e":149.535},{"w":"killing","s":149.535,"e":149.935},{"w":"barely","s":149.935,"e":150.255},{"w":"a","s":150.255,"e":150.415},{"w":"dozen.","s":150.415,"e":150.875}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":151.175,"end":156.887,"text":"Wait, \"went pear-shaped\"? I love that. Where does a pear come into a military disaster?","words":[{"w":"Wait,","s":151.175,"e":151.855},{"w":"\"went","s":151.935,"e":152.255},{"w":"pear-shaped\"?","s":152.255,"e":153.295},{"w":"I","s":153.295,"e":153.455},{"w":"love","s":153.455,"e":153.695},{"w":"that.","s":153.695,"e":154.175},{"w":"Where","s":154.175,"e":154.495},{"w":"does","s":154.495,"e":154.735},{"w":"a","s":154.735,"e":154.815},{"w":"pear","s":154.815,"e":155.055},{"w":"come","s":155.055,"e":155.295},{"w":"into","s":155.295,"e":155.535},{"w":"a","s":155.535,"e":155.695},{"w":"military","s":155.695,"e":156.175},{"w":"disaster?","s":156.175,"e":156.575}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":157.287,"end":166.9,"text":"It means going wrong after a promising start. Imagine drawing a circle that slowly collapses into a pear. The plan had a shape — then it didn't.","words":[{"w":"It","s":157.287,"e":157.48},{"w":"means","s":157.48,