han","start":209.038,"end":212.011,"text":"This is a cartoon. You're describing a cartoon.","words":[{"w":"This","s":209.038,"e":209.335},{"w":"is","s":209.335,"e":209.575},{"w":"a","s":209.575,"e":209.655},{"w":"cartoon.","s":209.655,"e":210.455},{"w":"You're","s":210.455,"e":210.695},{"w":"describing","s":210.695,"e":211.175},{"w":"a","s":211.175,"e":211.335},{"w":"cartoon.","s":211.335,"e":212.011}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":212.311,"end":220.948,"text":"The army had bitten off more than it could chew. Final tally: nearly ten thousand rounds fired, roughly a thousand emus down.","words":[{"w":"The","s":212.311,"e":212.535},{"w":"army","s":212.535,"e":212.935},{"w":"had","s":212.935,"e":213.175},{"w":"bitten","s":213.175,"e":213.415},{"w":"off","s":213.415,"e":213.735},{"w":"more","s":213.735,"e":213.975},{"w":"than","s":213.975,"e":214.135},{"w":"it","s":214.135,"e":214.295},{"w":"could","s":214.295,"e":214.535},{"w":"chew.","s":214.535,"e":214.775},{"w":"Final","s":215.66,"e":215.98},{"w":"tally:","s":215.98,"e":216.78},{"w":"nearly","s":216.86,"e":217.18},{"w":"ten","s":217.18,"e":217.58},{"w":"thousand","s":217.58,"e":217.9},{"w":"rounds","s":217.9,"e":218.3},{"w":"fired,","s":218.3,"e":219.02},{"w":"roughly","s":219.02,"e":219.42},{"w":"a","s":219.42,"e":219.66},{"w":"thousand","s":219.66,"e":219.98},{"w":"emus","s":219.98,"e":220.46},{"w":"down.","s":220.46,"e":220.948}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":221.248,"end":227.936,"text":"So biting off more than you can chew means taking on something too big to handle. Like a bite you literally can't swallow.","words":[{"w":"So","s":221.26,"e":221.5},{"w":"biting","s":221.5,"e":221.9},{"w":"off","s":221.9,"e":222.06},{"w":"more","s":222.06,"e":222.3},{"w":"than","s":222.3,"e":222.46},{"w":"you","s":222.46,"e":222.62},{"w":"can","s":222.62,"e":222.78},{"w":"chew","s":222.78,"e":223.02},{"w":"means","s":223.02,"e":223.34},{"w":"taking","s":223.34,"e":223.74},{"w":"on","s":223.74,"e":223.9},{"w":"something","s":223.9,"e":224.3},{"w":"too","s":224.3,"e":224.54},{"w":"big","s":224.54,"e":224.78},{"w":"to","s":224.78,"e":225.02},{"w":"handle.","s":225.02,"e":225.58},{"w":"Like","s":225.82,"e":225.98},{"w":"a","s":225.98,"e":226.14},{"w":"bite","s":226.14,"e":226.38},{"w":"you","s":226.38,"e":226.62},{"w":"literally","s":226.62,"e":227.02},{"w":"can't","s":227.02,"e":227.34},{"w":"swallow.","s":227.34,"e":227.66}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":228.236,"end":235.202,"text":"Exactly. Your ambition writes a check your ability can't cash. Ten bullets per bird, Ethan. Ten.","words":[{"w":"Exactly.","s":228.445,"e":229.165},{"w":"Your","s":229.325,"e":229.565},{"w":"ambition","s":229.565,"e":229.965},{"w":"writes","s":229.965,"e":230.285},{"w":"a","s":230.285,"e":230.525},{"w":"check","s":230.525,"e":230.685},{"w":"your","s":230.685,"e":230.925},{"w":"ability","s":230.925,"e":231.245},{"w":"can't","s":231.245,"e":231.725},{"w":"cash.","s":231.725,"e":232.285},{"w":"Ten","s":232.525,"e":232.845},{"w":"bullets","s":232.845,"e":233.165},{"w":"per","s":233.165,"e":233.485},{"w":"bird,","s":233.485,"e":233.885},{"w":"Ethan.","s":233.885,"e":234.605},{"w":"Ten.","s":234.605,"e":235.202}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":235.502,"end":241.167,"text":"I once bit off more than I could chew promising my mom a website in a weekend. Took four months.","words":[{"w":"I","s":235.502,"e":235.645},{"w":"once","s":235.645,"e":235.965},{"w":"bit","s":235.965,"e":236.205},{"w":"off","s":236.205,"e":236.365},{"w":"more","s":236.365,"e":236.605},{"w":"than","s":236.605,"e":236.765},{"w":"I","s":236.765,"e":236.925},{"w":"could","s":236.925,"e":237.085},{"w":"chew","s":237.085,"e":237.325},{"w":"promising","s":237.325,"e":237.885},{"w":"my","s":237.885,"e":238.045},{"w":"mom","s":238.045,"e":238.285},{"w":"a","s":238.285,"e":238.525},{"w":"website","s":238.525,"e":238.845},{"w":"in","s":238.845,"e":239.085},{"w":"a","s":239.085,"e":239.165},{"w":"weekend.","s":239.165,"e":239.805},{"w":"Took","s":239.965,"e":240.285},{